          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">Once per battle, after any enemy unit&apos;s Move step, as a reaction, you may&apos;dissipate the energy field&apos;. If you do, this unit&apos;s Sv changes to 4+. Then, each enemy unit within 12&quot; of and visible to this unit suffers D3+1 Suppression.</characteristic>
